@startuml sequence_review
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Relations - Historical distribution

actor User
participant "Scrubber" as Sc
participant "TileContext" as Ctx
participant "Tile" as T
participant "Controller" as C
participant "API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

User -> Sc: Pick 2025-12-01
Sc -> Ctx: selectedReviewDate
Ctx -> T: signal change
T -> C: load('review', '<date>')
C -> API: GET /relations/summary?asOf=<date>
API -> API: clamp asOf
API -> DB: SELECT bt.Id, bt.Name, COUNT(*)\nFROM Commitments c JOIN Behaviours b JOIN BehaviourTypes bt\nWHERE ProfileId=:p AND c.CreatedOn<=:asOf\n  AND (c.DeletedOn IS NULL OR c.DeletedOn>:asOf)\nGROUP BY bt.Id, bt.Name
DB --> API: rows
API -> API: percentages, top-N, sum-to-100 reconciliation
API --> C: { relations: [...] } + Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
C --> T: signal updates
T --> User: Historical distribution + REVIEW pill

@enduml
